I also ran into this and since I'm working with images on a project, had Claude add the following hook to check image dimensions as a `PreToolUse` hook. This doesn't fix the problem but it at least avoids corrupting the chat (which is highly disruptive to my workflow.)

---

`.claude/settings.local.json` - Hook configuration:
```json
{
  "hooks": {
    "PreToolUse": [
      {
        "matcher": "Read",
        "hooks": [{"type": "command", "command": ".claude/hooks/check-image-size.sh"}]
      }
